{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id183561278"}, "name":{"label":"Dr Yort"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-06T23:53:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.85.0"}, "id":{"label":"11806558554"}, "title":{"label":"Could be better"}, "content":{"label":"There are a plethora of hydration apps nowadays. This does what it says, like most of them do. However it’s not worth the price if it is incapable of syncing all of your data. It claims to sync, but all it does is backup your data to iCloud. It doesn’t synchronise any of your challenges, your avatars or your daily hydration progress details across multiple devices - i.e. if your daily workflow has you switching between an iPhone and iPad, you won’t see the data recorded on one device reflected on the other. For this app to earn 5 stars it needs to actually meet the current definition of a synched app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
