{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1353453698"}, "name":{"label":"Josephine_08_"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-27T23:17:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.85.0"}, "id":{"label":"11772961231"}, "title":{"label":"Highly Recommend!"}, "content":{"label":"As a person with ASD I often have trouble noticing the signals of my body. One of these is when I need to drink water. I am horrible at drinking an adequate amount of water daily, leading to headaches, fatigue and being pretty dehydrated. This app is really helpful in assisting me with my water intake. I like the fun visual of the llama as I drink water throughout the day and the fact that I can have a widget on my Lock Screen reminding me of how much water I have left to go in my day. A very good app! 😊\n\nUPDATE - Thank you developers for replying! I rated the app four stars as I would very much like more of the app to be accessible for free. Without paying it still provides me with drinking reminders and allows me to log my water intake in order to reach my daily goal. Although, almost all of the characters are limited and no other beverage can be logged except water. The app is awesome I just wish I could access a bit more without having to pay. Thank you!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
